---
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer" />
    <title>Publishing studio · depriver.tech</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/Poppins-Bold.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="publisher" data-api={site.engageApi}>
      <header class="top"><a href="/" class="brand">depriver<span>.tech</span></a><span class="private">PRIVATE STUDIO</span><button id="lock" hidden>Lock studio ↗</button></header>
      <main>
        <section id="login" class="login">
          <div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR IDEAS. OUT IN THE WORLD.</p><h1>A home for<br/>what’s next<span>.</span></h1><p class="intro">Shape your next post, plan the week, and keep your channels moving. All from one quiet place.</p><div class="platforms"><span>◎ Instagram</span><span>in LinkedIn</span><span>♪ TikTok handoff</span></div></div>
          <form id="unlock" class="login-card"><span class="eyebrow">OWNER ACCESS</span><h2>Open your studio</h2><p>Your content and connected accounts stay behind this sign-in.</p><label for="admin-key">Studio access key</label><input id="admin-key" name="key" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required placeholder="Enter your studio key"/><button class="primary" type="submit">Unlock studio <span>→</span></button><small>The key is kept only in this tab’s memory.</small></form>
        </section>
        <p id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <div id="workspace" hidden>
          <section class="heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PUBLISHING STUDIO</p><h1>Make good ideas travel<span>.</span></h1><p>One story. The right version for every channel.</p></div><div class="engine"><span id="engine-state"></span><button id="toggle-engine">Resume publishing</button></div></section>
          <div id="stats" class="stats"></div>
          <div class="toolbar"><nav aria-label="Studio views"><button data-view="library" aria-current="page">Content library</button><button data-view="queue">Publishing queue</button><button data-view="calendar">Calendar</button><button data-view="accounts">Connections</button></nav><button id="refresh">↻ Refresh</button></div>
          <section id="library-view"><div class="section-title"><div><h2>Your next stories</h2><p>Choose an article to prepare a post. Future content stays private here.</p></div><label class="search">Find an article<input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Search your library…"/></label></div><div id="library" class="cards"></div></section>
          <section id="queue-view" hidden><div class="section-title"><div><h2>From draft to published</h2><p>Review every result. Times are shown in Tanzania time (EAT).</p></div><label>Filter status<select id="status-filter"><option value="all">All posts</option><option>draft</option><option>scheduled</option><option>processing</option><option>published</option><option>failed</option><option>review</option><option>handoff</option></select></label></div><div id="queue" class="rows"></div></section>
          <section id="calendar-view" hidden><div class="section-title"><div><h2>Your publishing calendar</h2><p>Scheduled and published posts, grouped by date in Tanzania.</p></div></div><div id="calendar" class="rows"></div></section>
          <section id="accounts-view" hidden><div class="section-title"><div><h2>Your channels</h2><p>Connect once. Review authorization expiry here before planning ahead.</p></div></div><div id="accounts" class="cards"></div><aside class="help"><h3>Made for your content</h3><p>Instagram: professional accounts, JPEG images and carousels of up to 10 selected slides. LinkedIn: personal-profile text and article links. TikTok: prepare your caption and open the article’s media for manual publishing.</p><p>Connections require your developer apps to be configured by the site administrator. You never enter a social-media password in this studio.</p></aside></section>
        </div>
      </main>
      <footer><span>depriver.tech / publishing studio</span><span>Built for consistency, with room for a human touch.</span></footer>
      <dialog id="editor"><form id="editor-form"><header class="dialog-head"><span class="eyebrow">PREPARE A POST</span><button type="button" id="close-editor" aria-label="Close editor">✕</button></header><h2 id="editor-title"></h2><div class="editor-grid"><div class="fields"><label>Channel<select id="platform"><option value="instagram">Instagram · images</option><option value="linkedin">LinkedIn · text & link</option><option value="tiktok">TikTok · manual handoff</option></select></label><label>Caption<textarea id="caption" rows="9" required></textarea></label><span id="caption-count" class="muted"></span><label>Publish time · Tanzania (UTC+3)<input id="schedule" type="datetime-local" required/></label><p id="article-date" class="muted"></p><div id="media-controls"><div class="section-title"><h3>Choose your images</h3><button id="choose-poster" type="button">Use share image</button></div><p class="muted">Select 1–10 images, in article order. Nothing is removed automatically.</p><div id="media-options" class="media-grid"></div></div><p id="editor-note" role="status"></p></div><aside class="preview"><span class="eyebrow">POST PREVIEW</span><div class="preview-identity"><span class="avatar">p.</span><div><strong id="preview-name">depriver.tech</strong><small id="preview-channel">Instagram</small></div></div><img id="preview-image" alt="Selected post image"/><p id="preview-caption"></p><a id="preview-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the article ↗</a><small>Approximate preview. The platform controls the final layout.</small></aside></div><div class="dialog-actions"><span id="editor-state" class="muted">Save a draft, then schedule it when ready.</span><button type="submit" class="primary" id="save-draft">Save draft</button></div><div id="job-actions" class="job-actions"></div><details id="history"><summary>Activity history</summary><ol id="events"></ol></details></form></dialog>
    </div>
    <script>
      import '../../scripts/publisher';
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
<style is:global>
  @font-face{font-family:Poppins;src:url('/fonts/Poppins-Bold.woff2') format('woff2');font-weight:700;font-display:swap}
  :root{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;color:#19332f;background:#f5f6f2;font-synthesis:none;--green:#163f35;--muted:#63736d;--line:#dce2d9}
  *{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}button,input,textarea,select{font:inherit}button,a,input,textarea,select{outline-offset:4px}button{cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;background:white;color:var(--green);padding:10px 15px;font-weight:600}button:hover{background:#e9eee6}button:disabled{opacity:.48;cursor:not-allowed}a{color:var(--green)}[hidden]{display:none!important}.top{height:90px;max-width:1400px;margin:auto;padding:0 40px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.brand{text-decoration:none;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-1px}.brand span{font-weight:400;color:#7b8d72}.private{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;border-left:1px solid #bdc9bb;padding-left:24px;color:var(--muted)}#lock{margin-left:auto}main{max-width:1320px;margin:auto;padding:32px 32px 90px;min-height:calc(100vh - 165px)}h1,h2,h3,p{margin-top:0}h1,h2{font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-1.6px;line-height:1.2}h1{font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px);margin-bottom:18px}h1 span{color:#96b86d}h2{font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.7px}h3{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-.3px}.eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:750;color:#718461;margin-bottom:18px}.login{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:100px;align-items:center;min-height:65vh;padding:45px 25px}.login h1{font-size:clamp(44px,5vw,72px);letter-spacing:-3px}.intro{font-size:18px;line-height:1.75;max-width:470px;color:var(--muted)}.platforms{display:flex;gap:20px;font-size:12px;margin-top:40px}.login-card{padding:40px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;background:white;box-shadow:0 20px 60px #123d2f08}.login-card p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;font-size:14px}.login-card label{margin-top:26px}.login-card input{margin-bottom:18px}.login-card .primary{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.login-card small{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:16px}.primary{background:var(--green);color:white;border-color:var(--green)}.primary:hover{background:#275b4d}label{display:grid;gap:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:650;color:#435950}input,select,textarea{border:1px solid #cdd8c9;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;padding:12px;color:#183b31;width:100%;min-width:0}textarea{resize:vertical;line-height:1.65;font-size:14px}#notice{padding:0;margin:0;color:#a33728;white-space:pre-wrap}#notice:not(:empty){padding:14px 18px;background:#fff4dc;border-radius:9px;margin-bottom:18px}.heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:25px;padding:24px 0}.heading p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.heading .eyebrow{font-size:10px}.engine{display:grid;justify-items:start;gap:12px;flex-shrink:0;font-size:12px}.engine span:before{content:'';display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;margin-right:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#c3954b}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;background:white;margin:8px 0 32px}.stat{padding:22px 26px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.stat:last-child{border:0}.stat strong{display:block;font-size:29px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-1px}.stat span{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:var(--muted)}.toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);gap:18px;margin-bottom:28px}.toolbar nav{display:flex;gap:24px;overflow:auto}.toolbar nav button{border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;border-radius:0;background:none;padding:18px 0;white-space:nowrap;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.toolbar nav button[aria-current=page]{color:var(--green);border-bottom-color:var(--green)}#refresh{font-size:12px;padding:7px 11px}.section-title{display:flex;gap:20px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:22px}.section-title h2{margin-bottom:8px}.section-title p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:0;line-height:1.6}.search{min-width:235px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.card-image{aspect-ratio:1.8;object-fit:cover;width:100%;background:#e5ebdf}.card-body{padding:23px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1}.card h3{font-size:17px;line-height:1.5}.card p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted)}.card-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.7px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:15px}.card button{margin-top:auto;align-self:start;font-size:12px}.badge{display:inline-block;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;padding:5px 8px;background:#edf0e8;color:#44634c;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px}.badge.failed,.badge.review{background:#fff0de;color:#984c17}.badge.published{background:#dfefde;color:#2c6634}.rows{display:grid;gap:12px}.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:23px;background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px}.row h3{margin:8px 0}.row p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.row .error{color:#a44c2a}.row button{flex-shrink:0}.empty{padding:55px;text-align:center;border:1px dashed #cbd7c6;border-radius:12px;color:var(--muted);grid-column:1/-1}.help{margin-top:25px;padding:25px;border-left:3px solid #9eb380;background:#edf0e7}.help p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:10px}.muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}footer{max-width:1320px;margin:auto;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:22px 32px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}dialog{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:30px;width:min(1020px,95vw);max-height:92vh;background:#f9faf7;color:#19332f}dialog::backdrop{background:#0b241cc9;backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}.dialog-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.dialog-head .eyebrow{margin:0}.dialog-head button{background:none;border:none}.editor-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:35px}.fields{display:grid;gap:13px}.fields p{margin:0}.preview{align-self:start;background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:22px;overflow:hidden}.preview-identity{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:22px 0}.avatar{display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--green);color:white;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;font-weight:bold}.preview strong{font-size:12px}.preview small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:4px}#preview-image{width:100%;max-height:330px;object-fit:contain;background:#edf0e8;border-radius:5px}#preview-caption{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:12px;line-height:1.75;margin-top:17px}#preview-source{font-size:12px}.media-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px}.media-grid label{position:relative;cursor:pointer}.media-grid img{width:100%;border:2px solid transparent;border-radius:5px}.media-grid input{position:absolute;top:5px;left:5px;width:16px;height:16px;accent-color:var(--green)}.media-grid label:has(input:checked) img{border-color:var(--green)}.media-grid span{font-size:10px;text-align:center}.dialog-actions{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:25px;padding-top:20px}.job-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:15px}#editor-note{color:#a33728;font-size:13px}.fields .section-title{margin-bottom:10px;margin-top:12px}.fields .section-title h3{margin:0}.fields .section-title button{font-size:10px}details{margin-top:20px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}details li{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.calendar-date{margin:24px 0 10px;font-size:15px}
  @media(max-width:900px){.login{gap:35px;padding:25px 0}.cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.heading{align-items:start}.heading h1{max-width:450px}.platforms{flex-wrap:wrap}.editor-grid{gap:20px}}
  @media(max-width:600px){.top{padding:0 20px;height:75px;gap:14px}.brand{font-size:19px}.private{padding-left:14px;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:8px}main{padding:25px 18px 60px}.login{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.login h1{font-size:46px}.login-card{padding:25px}.intro{font-size:15px}.platforms{margin-top:24px}.heading{display:block}.engine{margin-bottom:20px}.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.stat{padding:17px}.stat:nth-child(2){border-right:0}.stat:nth-child(-n+2){border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.toolbar{gap:10px}.toolbar nav{gap:18px}.toolbar nav button{font-size:12px}.section-title{align-items:start;flex-direction:column}.search{width:100%}.row{padding:17px;align-items:start}.row h3{font-size:14px}.row button{padding:8px;font-size:11px}.editor-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}dialog{padding:20px}dialog h2{font-size:22px}.preview{order:2}.dialog-actions{align-items:start}.dialog-actions span{max-width:150px}footer{padding:20px;gap:20px}footer span:last-child{display:none}.help{padding:18px}}
</style>
